<p>The below spreadsheet is a listing of all errata since Virtual Set 10 (early 2019). It summarizes the above PDF's into one location, and will be updated as new errata are announced. Thanks to Eric Garchow for drafting this file and to Drew Lichtenstein for subsequent updates. <a href="https://tinyurl.com/SWCCGErrata">https://tinyurl.com/SWCCGErrata</a></p>
<h3>BLANKED Cards:</h3>
<p>Below is a list of all virtual cards that have been "blanked" (deleted) since the 2014 Reset.</p>
<ul>
<li>Dec 2017 - Anakin’s Lightsaber (V) (Set 0 version, replaced by new Set 10 version)</li>
<li>Dec 2019 - Imperial Domination (V) (Set 0) (replaced by Imperial Enforcement)</li>
<li>Dec 2019 - Strategic Reserves (V) (Set 4)</li>
<li>Mar 2020 - Young Skywalker (Set 8 version, replaced by new Set 22 version)</li>
<li>Oct 2020 - Ability, Ability, Ability (V) (Set 0)</li>
<li>Oct 2020 - Civil Disorder (V) (Set 0)</li>
<li>Oct 2020 - Firepower (V) (Set 0)</li>
<li>Oct 2020 - Weapons Display (V) (Set 0)</li>
<li>Mar 2021 - Evacuation Control (V) (Set 0) (replaced by I Don't Like Sand)</li>
<li>Mar 2021 - Imperial Justice (V) (Set 0) (replaced by Coarse And Rough And Irritating)</li>
<li>Mar 2021 - Help Me Obi-Wan Kenobi &amp; Quite A Mercenary (Set 12)</li>
<li>Mar 2021 - Twilight Is Upon Me (V) (Set 12 version, replaced by new Set 22 version)</li>
<li>Sep 2022 - Drop! (V) (Set 3 version, replaced by new Set D version)</li>
<li>Sep 2022 - Thrown Back (V) (Set 3 version, replaced by new Set D version)</li>
<li>Dec 2022 - Ralltiir Operations / In The Hands Of The Empire (V) (Set 10)</li>
<li>Jul 2023 - Macroscan (V) (Set 10)</li>
<li>Jul 2024 - A Useless Gesture (V) (Set D)</li>
<li>Jul 2024 - Death Star Sentry (V) (Set D)</li>
<li>Jul 2024 - I Find Your Lack Of Faith Disturbing (V) (Set D)</li>
<li>Jul 2024 - Imperial Detention (Set D)</li>
<li>Jul 2024 - Affect Mind (V) (Set D)</li>
<li>Jul 2024 - Clumsy And Stupid (Set D)</li>
<li>Jul 2024 - Goldenrod (Set D)</li>
<li>Jul 2024 - Ounee Ta (V) (Set D Defensive Shield version only, the Set 18 Effect is not cut)</li>
<li>Jul 2024 - Yavin Sentry (V) (Set D)</li>
<li>Dec 2024 - A Good Blaster At Your Side &amp; Restricted Deployment (Set 18)</li>
<li>May 2026 - No Bargain (V)</li>
</ul>
<p><em>NOTES:</em></p>
<p><em>-In April 2022, Jabba's Prize (V) received significant errata, including a card title change to The Mythrol. This is considered an errata rather than a blanked card.</em></p>
<p><em>-In July 2023, A Brave Resistance (Set 9) was blanked, but it returned with errata in October 2023.</em></p>
<p><em>-In July 2024, many Defensive Shields were added, errata'd, and cut in a large-scale Defensive Shield Realignment.</em></p>
<p><em>-In December 2024, these cards received errata that included card title updates: BoShek (V) is now BoShek, Gritty Smuggler. Obi-Wan Kenobi In Radiant VII is now Madakor In Radiant VII. Close The Blast Doors! is now Blast Door Controls (V). Sith Probe Droid (V) is now DRK-1 (Dark Eye Probe Droid). These are considered errata rather than blanked cards.<br/>
</em></p>
</div>
