<div>
<span>Legacy Blocks</span>
<i></i>
</div>
<div id="fl-tabs-5f3a9b4fe9cc9-panel-5">
<p>These are <strong>Legacy virtual cards produced before the rese</strong>t.</p>
<p><strong>These cards should not be used unless playing in a legacy card approved game.</strong></p>
<p><em>If you are just starting out, these are not the cards you are looking for. Use the Set PDFs instead.</em></p>
<p> </p>
